{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% from "_macros.html.j2" import chart, key %}
{% block title %}Track B{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Track B: raw DuckDB entry points over Parquet</h1>
<section class="card">
  <h2>Why VillageSQL is a separate track</h2>
  <p>VillageSQL's <code>vsql_duckdb</code> is not a storage engine. It adds functions, <code>duckdb_query(sql)</code> and
    <code>duckdb_scalar(sql)</code>, that run DuckDB SQL verbatim over external files (Parquet, CSV, JSON) and return the
    result as a JSON string. Ordinary SQL on MySQL tables is never routed to DuckDB, and DuckDB cannot read InnoDB tables.
    Results are capped by <code>max_result_bytes</code> and <code>KILL QUERY</code> does not reach the embedded DuckDB.</p>
  <p>That is a different design, not a lesser one, so it is measured on its own workload: TPC-H as local Parquet files, the
    22 queries sent through each system's raw DuckDB entry point, plus the JSON_TABLE join with an InnoDB table that
    VillageSQL documents. Comparators on the same files are plain DuckDB 1.5.5, pg_duckdb <code>duckdb.query()</code> and
    MariaDB <code>run_in_duckdb()</code>. Track B results are never placed on a Track A chart and Track A systems are not
    compared with these numbers.</p>
</section>
{% if empty or not systems %}
<p class="card empty">No Track B results have been published yet.</p>
{% else %}
{{ key() }}
<div class="controls" id="controls" data-controls="sf,systems,metric"></div>
{% if left_out %}
<p class="note">Left out of the common query set (SF{{ default_sf }}):
  {% for e in left_out %}{{ e.label }} ({{ e.reason }}){{ "; " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}. Their own totals are still shown.</p>
{% endif %}
{{ chart("trackb_total", "Total query time, common queries (s)", "Sum of warm medians over the queries every system ran correctly.", 320) }}
{{ chart("trackb_query", "Per-query time (s, log scale)", "Same layout as Track A. The join item exists only for VillageSQL (its documented pattern).", 460, true) }}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
{% block scripts %}{% if not empty and systems %}{% include "_data.html.j2" %}{% endif %}{% endblock %}
